      "title": {
        "en": "Narzędnik: the plural"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "In the plural, the instrumental ends in *-ami* for almost every noun: *z frytkami*, *z oliwkami*, *z grzybami*. An adjective takes *-ymi* (*-imi* after *k* and *g*): *z zielonymi oliwkami*. A few nouns take *-mi* instead: remember *z dziećmi* (with the children)."
      },
